  "prefLabel": "Per 102.22 Classification system",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.22 “Classification system” means the processes, policies, and procedures specific to the classification and pay assignment of all positions in the classified service in the state of New Hampshire and not including unclassified or non-classified positions.\n\nSource. #13667, eff 6-22-23; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.19), eff 12-1-25",
